L1: Early administration of Vitamin C in patients with sepsis or septic shock in emergency departments: A multicenter, double blinded, randomized controlled trial: The C-EASIE trial protocol
L2: PLoS ONE (2021)
L3: Stefanie Vandervelden, Lina Wauters, Jan Breuls, Steffen Fieuws, Philippe Vanhove, Ives Hubloue, Magali Bartiaux, Jacques Creteur, François Stifkens, Koen Monsieurs, Didier Desruelles
