L228: | Yes | Objectives | 7 | Specific objectives or hypotheses |
L229: | Yes | Trial design | 8 | Description of trial design including type of trial (eg, parallel group, crossover, factorial, single group), allocation ratio, and framework (eg, superiority, equivalence, noninferiority, exploratory) |
L230: |  | Methods: Participants, interventions, and outcomes | Methods: Participants, interventions, and outcomes | Methods: Participants, interventions, and outcomes |
